  "caveat": [
    "A one-way declaration is a real claim by the declaring unit. It is counted, not treated as an error: a composition A wants is not wrong merely because B never reciprocated.",
    "Port compatibility is checked by type string. Two units whose ports share a type are recorded as meeting, which is the weakest available reading -- a real composition may still be impossible for reasons a type string does not capture.",
